    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_FullingMillPlaced_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "A water-powered fulling mill whose trip hammers beat finished cloth to raise its quality."
  },
  "CardHelpSection": {
    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_fulling_mill_placed",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_FullingMillPlaced_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Requirements:</b> Requires a local mill race for water power.\n\n<b>Operation:</b> Load finished cloth (Small, Medium or Large Cloth), then press Full All to beat the whole batch and raise each piece's Quality by a step.\n\n<b>Time:</b> Full All takes 1.5 hours.\n\n<b>Limit:</b> Fulling brings cloth up to a fair finish only; the last of a piece's quality still comes from better fibre at the loom."
  },
